    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> Genie power suffuses you for the duration: you gain Resistance to Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning or Thunder damage (chosen when you cast) and a Fly Speed of 30 ft with hover. When you cast it, and at the start of each of your later turns (Elemental Pulse activity), each creature of your choice in a 15-ft Emanation makes a DEX save: 2d6 damage of an element you choose and Prone on a failure, half damage only on a success.</p>",
